    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569510/extras/bcf37dbe0ee621fe0fab8cde69c15acc.avif?t=1755060804\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569510/extras/9d3bd3aadd768ce2d660cd1d2b85de75.avif?t=1755060804\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569510/extras/b3c0d646e12e3264689d246bdb352aa4.avif?t=1755060804\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569510/extras/63b8805d126b1326e57e855edd958185.avif?t=1755060804\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569510/extras/a0d5d42ddf5062523ca330a3e3618487.avif?t=1755060804\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569510/extras/69bee63f8fa0b20dfb25bf0df9cbca9b.avif?t=1755060804\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Enjoy an Officially Licensed MLB Baseball Game Anytime, Anywhere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the fully integrated 2025 MLB schedule, and take on the World Series with 2025 Live Cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game now features baseball legends from the National Baseball Hall of Fame\u2014available as brand-new cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game chosen by 2-time National League MVP Bryce Harper, MLB Rivals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 MLB Rivals Game Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[NEW]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># New Development Transfer System: Transfer development to new cards of the same position!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># New League Difficulty: Push your limits and take on a tougher challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># Locker Room: Unlock Clubhouse Leader and boost your leader\u2019s stats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># The television voices for the Los Angeles Dodgers Joe Davis (play-by-play) and Orel Hershiser (commentary)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[REAL]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># 2025 MLB season schedule, stadiums, and uniforms fully featured!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># 2025 Live Cards that reflect real-time performance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># Realistic player motions captured with cutting-edge technology!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># Relive the most thrilling moments with the Replay system!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[PLAY]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># [Quick Play, Spotlight Batting, or Full Play]: Choose how you want to enjoy the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># Ranked Slugger: Become the true Home Run King!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># Live Match: Face off against rivals from around the world in real time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># Club Battle: Join forces with your Club members to challenge the top clubs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[EASY]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># No more complicated controls! Enjoy simple one-touch play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># Speed through games with Quick Play and play speed settings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># Grow your players with ease! Improved Consecutive Upgrade feature!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the thrill of baseball action with MLB Rivals!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569510/extras/bcf37dbe0ee621fe0fab8cde69c15acc.avif?t=1755060804\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569510/extras/9d3bd3aadd768ce2d660cd1d2b85de75.avif?t=1755060804\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569510/extras/b3c0d646e12e3264689d246bdb352aa4.avif?t=1755060804\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569510/extras/63b8805d126b1326e57e855edd958185.avif?t=1755060804\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569510/extras/a0d5d42ddf5062523ca330a3e3618487.avif?t=1755060804\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569510/extras/69bee63f8fa0b20dfb25bf0df9cbca9b.avif?t=1755060804\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Enjoy an Officially Licensed MLB Baseball Game Anytime, Anywhere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the fully integrated 2025 MLB schedule, and take on the World Series with 2025 Live Cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game now features baseball legends from the National Baseball Hall of Fame\u2014available as brand-new cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game chosen by 2-time National League MVP Bryce Harper, MLB Rivals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 MLB Rivals Game Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[NEW]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># New Development Transfer System: Transfer development to new cards of the same position!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># New League Difficulty: Push your limits and take on a tougher challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># Locker Room: Unlock Clubhouse Leader and boost your leader\u2019s stats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># The television voices for the Los Angeles Dodgers Joe Davis (play-by-play) and Orel Hershiser (commentary)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[REAL]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># 2025 MLB season schedule, stadiums, and uniforms fully featured!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># 2025 Live Cards that reflect real-time performance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># Realistic player motions captured with cutting-edge technology!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># Relive the most thrilling moments with the Replay system!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[PLAY]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># [Quick Play, Spotlight Batting, or Full Play]: Choose how you want to enjoy the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># Ranked Slugger: Become the true Home Run King!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># Live Match: Face off against rivals from around the world in real time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># Club Battle: Join forces with your Club members to challenge the top clubs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[EASY]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># No more complicated controls! Enjoy simple one-touch play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># Speed through games with Quick Play and play speed settings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># Grow your players with ease! Improved Consecutive Upgrade feature!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the thrill of baseball action with MLB Rivals!</p>",
